<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Soundview cuts Hewlett.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Soundview cuts Hewlett.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview Financial analyst Russell Crabs cut his near-term rating on Hewlett-Packard Co to hold from buy, but maintained his long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The analyst also reduced his 1997 fiscal year estimate to $3.22 per share by a penny from $3.23 per share and cut his fiscal 1998 estimate to $3.75 from $3.87 per share previously.</p>
<p>((-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736))</p>
</text>
